        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[GLAM - Graphics Layer Abstraction Module doing the Rope Demo]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[GLAM hopes to be a simple abstraction of complex interactive graphics. The initial commit is tested to replicate the rope demo in a previous reddit post. A single line of code chooses the backend graphical layer, the rest of the code is identical for both the graphical output and the interactivity.]]></description>
            <pubDate>2026.08</pubDate>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://github.com/saiftynet/GLAM</guid>
            <link>https://github.com/saiftynet/GLAM</link>
            
            
            
